+ * @pci_dev: pointer to pci dev
+ * @sdiodev: SDIO device data
+ * @enabled: Set if embedded platform has been enabled (i.e. fw loaded and
+ *          ipc started)
+ * @enable: Configure communication with the fw (i.e. configure the transf=
ers
